                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Very fun to look at and very fun to play. Terrific party game. Good for 2-4 players and an audience. Lovely, clean aesthetic, great sound design, great music, great humor.\nThe main mechanic is that you can stretch or shrink your tube-person to control the ball or your opponent. The more you stretch, the more ball control you have, but the less pushing power you have. By shrinking, you sacrifice some ball control in exchange for more pushing power. You'll frequently be switching between offensive and defensive tactics during a match, so adjust your tube-person accordingly. (That's a sentence I never thought I'd say)\nMultiple game modes, and if you find the secret, you can play as weiner dogs. :-)\n\nLovely thing. Can't recommend enough. Pick up this game, pick up a pizza, have some friends over, and have a blast.",
